# URL of the quickcart-backend-enterprise service.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Which tenant this storefront belongs to. Sent as X-Organization-Slug on
# every request. If you're running multiple tenants from genuinely
# different storefront deployments (e.g. one Vercel project per tenant),
# each deployment gets its own value here. If instead you want ONE
# deployment to serve multiple tenants (e.g. picking the org from a
# subdomain), you'll need to change lib/api.ts to resolve this dynamically
# per-request instead of reading a single build-time env var — not done
# here, since most teams start with one storefront per tenant and only need
# dynamic resolution once that stops being true.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ORGANIZATION_SLUG=quickcart-lagos
